        \KL(\P \| \sQ) = \E_{\P}\left[\log\dfrac{\dif \P}{\dif \sQ}\right] = \E_{\P}\left[ \int_0^T \left( \eta_t \gL_t \eta_t^{-1} + \gL_t \log \eta_t \right)(x_t) \dif t\right] := \mathfrak{L}[\eta_t],

